# Lilah and Goliath Daydreamer both replace the Helix's move to the graveyard as it resolves (CR 614.1a), whichever trigger
# resolved last; its controller chooses which applies as it resolves (CR 616.1). Bot1 chooses the dream exile: the Helix is
# exiled with a dream counter, Lilah's replacement no longer applies, and it is not plotted.

